303
00:17:31.550 --> 00:17:33.930
Ya, aku akan senang menemanimu.

304
00:17:37.930 --> 00:17:39.020
Tolong!

305
00:17:39.100 --> 00:17:40.810
Panggil ambulans!

306
00:17:43.190 --> 00:17:46.610
Hadirin, terima kasih
sudah bergabung dengan kami.

307
00:17:46.690 --> 00:17:51.700
Sekarang kita akan memulai
Lelang Midas ke-74.

308
00:17:52.160 --> 00:17:54.370
Berkat mengajak Irene,

309
00:17:54.450 --> 00:17:57.240
